  "description": "Official SDK for consuming TAF.CRUD microservice. Provides both synchronous (MediatR) and asynchronous (RabbitMQ) CRUD operations with fluent query builder API. v3.0.1: Updated TAF.Infra.Contract to v1.9.0 (centralized OperationResult pattern from TAF.Infra). v3.0.0: BREAKING - Query() renamed to Entity(). Added stored query execution (Query/QueryById), server-side pagination (Skip/Take), and Parameters() for LINQ-style fluent API. Fixed SDK pagination from in-memory to server-side. v2.0.4: Updated TAF.Infra.Contract to v1.5.1 (optimized connection management with ResolvedConnection pattern). v2.0.0: Breaking - Context → BusContext (MassTransit v2.0.0 compatibility).",
